learly use it  way more frequently than once a decade  at one point shisui wanted to use this  kenjutsu to avoid the uchiha clan  downfall  but his right eye was stolen by danzo  who definitely wasn't a fan of that plan  donzo used it over the years to do shady  danzo things  while the other eye was given to hitachi  hitachi put in a crow and then put the  crow in naruto weird i know  when naruto saw sasuke with his  transplanted itachi eyes the crow would  have convinced sasuke to save konoha  rather than to attack it however due to  the edo tensei  it ended up being used on hitachi  himself both donzo and itachi destroyed  the eyes so nobody else could use them  that's how dangerous even these  experienced and skilled fighters  consider them to be  we don't see shisui susano in action in  any canon materials but in the naruto  games he has a green version that has a  drill like lance  and it can also shoot chakra needles at  opponents lastly i'll point out that  shisui had much more going for him than  just his mind control  in the manga shisui was said to be one  of the most talented uchiha  and the best ever at teleportation  however shisui used insane speed to  seemingly teleport notably his body  flicker or teleportation technique  is not actually a space-time ninjutsu  like sasuke's space shifting ability  next let's look at sara daochiha the  daughter of our boy sasuke and one of  the main characters of the boruto series  like naruto did she wants to become  hokage and boruto wants to become a  great shinobi so he can support her  sarada has yet to awaken her mangekyo  shot and gone so we don't know what her  unique mangekyo powers will be  but she is skilled with her shotgun she  can use her eyes to do regular shot and  gone things like cask and jutsu  the spell genjutsu sea chakra and copy  techniques she's also been able to use  her shot and gun like a microscope in  order to clearly see something as small  as viruses  she has sakura's devastatingly power